    "kind": "change",
    "title": "Change in state conflict",
    "intent": "Preserve case of X-Forwarded-* headers during normalization.\n\nUpstreams behind the legacy LB match X-Forwarded-For case-sensitively. normalize_headers lowercases everything, which breaks them. Keep lowercase for HTTP/2 (required), but preserve the original case on HTTP/1.1 upstream hops, for X-Forwarded-* only.\n\nDon't touch HeaderMap iteration order; c-1039 just fixed it.",
    "target_branch": "develop",
    "state": "conflict",
